## Changes from Main Branch
The dev branch differs from the main/master branch in that:
- Additional custom workflows are present
- Build automation is enhanced and customized
- Documentation is specific to this branch
- Some defaults may differ from upstream
- No guarantee of upstream compatibility
---
## Reverting to Stable
To use stable, production-ready builds:
- Switch to the main/master branch
- Use official releases from KSU_Builder or KernelSU
- Refer to upstream project documentation
- Review the official license terms
